    "## 2. Two-Group Hypothesis Testing\n",
    "\n",
    "Comparing pairs of players using:\n",
    "- **Welch's t-test**: Parametric test for difference in means (unequal variances)\n",
    "- **Mann-Whitney U**: Non-parametric test for difference in distributions\n",
    "\n",
    "Both tests return effect sizes (Cohen's d) and 95% confidence intervals for the difference."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Initialize hypothesis tester\n",
    "tester = HypothesisTester(min_balls_per_innings=10)\n",
    "\n",
    "# Compare notable player pairs\n",
    "pairs = [\n",
    "    ('V Kohli', 'RG Sharma'),\n",
    "    ('CH Gayle', 'AB de Villiers'),\n",
    "    ('DA Warner', 'KL Rahul'),\n",
    "    ('MS Dhoni', 'SV Samson'),\n",
    "]\n",
    "\n",
    "for p1, p2 in pairs:\n",
    "    print(f\"\\n{'='*60}\")\n",
    "    print(f\"{p1} vs {p2} - Strike Rate\")\n",
    "    print(f\"{'='*60}\")\n",
    "    \n",
    "    result = tester.compare_players(p1, p2, 'strike_rate')\n",
    "    \n",
    "    welch = result['welch_t_test']\n",
    "    mw = result['mann_whitney_u']\n",
    "    rec = result['recommendation']\n",
    "    \n",
    "    print(f\"\\nWelch's t-test:\")\n",
    "    print(f\"  t = {welch.get('test_statistic', 'N/A'):.4f}\")\n",
    "    print(f\"  p = {welch.get('p_value', 'N/A'):.6f}\")\n",
    "    print(f\"  df = {welch.get('degrees_of_freedom', 'N/A'):.1f}\")\n",
    "    print(f\"  Cohen's d = {welch.get('cohens_d', 'N/A'):.3f}\")\n",
    "    print(f\"  Mean diff CI: [{welch.get('mean_diff_ci_lower', 'N/A'):.2f}, {welch.get('mean_diff_ci_upper', 'N/A'):.2f}]\")\n",
    "    print(f\"  Reject H0: {welch.get('reject_null', 'N/A')}\")\n",
    "    \n",
    "    print(f\"\\nMann-Whitney U:\")\n",
    "    print(f\"  U = {mw.get('test_statistic', 'N/A'):.1f}\")\n",
    "    print(f\"  p = {mw.get('p_value', 'N/A'):.6f}\")\n",
    "    print(f\"  Reject H0: {mw.get('reject_null', 'N/A')}\")\n",
    "    \n",
    "    print(f\"\\nRecommendation: {rec['test']} - {rec['reason']}\")"
   ]
